ourney packed with jumping, exploring, and action combat. Collect ammo and health, smash obstacles with powerful hits, and take on enemies across colorful worlds. Discover secrets, interact with objects, and keep moving forward in this lively platformer adventure!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "2560 x 1440 (1).png", "id": "3916489165148717", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820441_3916489168482050_3962473572948157318_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sPtMRgevykMQ7kNvwFDIry8&_nc_oc=AdpVpmfktK_sHu1WEKm0PewooiE1rTP4m2kAt40jM5QK6naplXWgs-lxBBKd8m-xBqc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4Z3wdVuQIQuLd02goy-i8DYuPcrAG7UJWaH_9M7dyqUA&oe=6A11D042"}, {"file_name": "3000 X 900.png", "id": "1818917172117398", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824318_1818917175450731_1640788482048149913_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0bwxCUwILtgQ7kNvwFKrAx4&_nc_oc=Adr30t1hJhhK4R02EYNUHZYzWIkwM9oUo69hrqKAnMouVJCAJ-2_ZCJ3PiJdiQ5S2Ow&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4ijfOqjoo_LiXG0OlsxxhYYVB4wwY7ZMTczGJVb5Z2gQ&oe=6A11AC1D"}, {"file_name": "1440 X 1440.png", "id": "1606536434093786", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825257_1606536440760452_2949884837810169644_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g7D9oSvBKZ4Q7kNvwGvtkUb&_nc_oc=Ado1rlNqFjxzcFudpamoEvsD5Omd7tEoO3EXTKOwvzF8dBW32ctUXLMKLVdGDpVNy4Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6lNMvRsfVxLwCXNmo5VEwvz2Xbxa9LqCGO_b3_fMvjiw&oe=6A11A56A"}, {"file_name": "1008 X 1440.png", "id": "1506860000409719", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304952_1506860007076385_7354609293117265353_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iApDtJLUWWsQ7kNvwE5